# Opens Files from the launcher's home screen and goes Home, three times (docs/boot.md, B19: the media provider must
# answer every open, with no restart and no ANR): a swipe up opens the all-apps drawer, a tap on the Files icon at
# display (205, 201) (the drawer's first row is Calculator, Files, Settings: docs/demo.md, tools/ui-points.mjs), Home
# (KEY_HOMEPAGE on the keyboard, dev 1) 60 s after the tap, and the same at +400 s and +700 s.
# "ms dev type code value" from the first open of a device, or, after --restore, from the restore (engine/evdev.c).
# For a boot, shift the times past the launcher's start (the first open is the input service's, early in the boot).
